insert into public.carmitra_blogs(title,category,body,published) values('Waterless Car Wash: The Future of Eco-Friendly Car Care','Eco Friendly','A clean car does not always need a hose. Waterless washing uses a purpose-made solution and soft microfibre towels to lift light dirt from a vehicle’s finish.
How it works
The solution is applied to a small section at a time to loosen and lubricate surface dirt. A clean towel lifts it away; a separate towel finishes the surface. Clean towels and gentle technique matter as much as the product.
When it makes sense
Waterless care can work for light dust and routine upkeep. Heavy mud, sand or stubborn grime may need rinsing or a low-water foam approach first. The method should fit the vehicle’s condition.
Care beyond water
Correct product use, sensible waste handling and attention to the surrounding space matter. Avoid dry wiping dusty paint and use products suitable for each surface.
Doorstep care in Jaipur
CarMitra includes waterless and low-water foam options. Choose the right level of cleaning for your vehicle.',true);
insert into public.carmitra_faqs(question,answer) values ('Where is CarMitra available?','Phase 1 is only in Jaipur, Rajasthan. Specific locality availability and slots will be confirmed when online bookings open.'),('Can I choose a waterless wash?','Yes. Waterless or low-water foam options are planned. The right method depends on the dirt level and condition of your vehicle.'),('Do you care for bikes too?','Yes. Bike wash, polish and chain care are included. Bike prices will appear after they are configured.'),('How do I book a service?','Choose Book now to explore the booking flow. Sign-in and confirmed slots will open when service capacity is available.'),('What does the 7-day service warranty cover?','CarMitra’s service promise is a 7-day warranty. Detailed coverage and claim terms will be available before live bookings.'),('Can I join as a technician?','Explore the partner page and prepare your application details. Secure document submission and verification will open with the verification service.');
commit;